{'symbol': 'JCI', 'date': '2021-09-23 06:55:00', 'title': 'JOHNSON CONTROLS AND PHYLAGEN SIGN HEALTHY BUILDINGS JOINT DEVELOPMENT AGREEMENT', 'text': 'CORK, IRELAND, SEPT. 23, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0 JOHNSON CONTROLS (NYSE: JCI), THE GLOBAL LEADER FOR SMART, HEALTHY AND SUSTAINABLE BUILDINGS, TODAY ANNOUNCED IT HAS SIGNED A JOINT DEVELOPMENT AGREEMENT WITH PHYLAGEN , A LEADING BIOTECHNOLOGY COMPANY IN THE FIELD OF MICROBIOME OPTIMIZATION OF INDOOR ENVIRONMENTS.'}